sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-morphometric-validation> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Uriz et al. (2003) & Aizenberg et al. (2005) sponge spicule silicatein axial symmetry, concentric biosilica lamination, Euplectella checkerboard lattice mechanics, cohesive-zone laminate bending, helical cage ridges and basalia waveguiding — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1828-2037) now returns 18 reference-anchored entries and the self-test checks all 12 items. Credited as genuine comparisons: W_lam / W_mono = 1.714 vs the table's 8.95 (an honest failed comparison, L1956-1965), h_25 / h_1 = 0.1311 vs Aizenberg's 0.2 / 1.5 = 0.1333 (L1986-1995), mode count 20 vs Gloge V^2 / 2 = 20.3 (L2026-2035), fused-interlayer ablation = monolith (L1966-1975). Deductions: the two headline Pass 2 correlations (r_angle = r_toughness = 1.0000, L1855-1874) are against Pass 1 recalled table values that were written onto the model laws, so they validate nothing (-6); the k_cat -> N = 25 measurement has reference 25 by calibration (L1976-1985) (-2); the ovalization-gain entry compares an exact sum with its own closed form (L2006-2015), the ray-trace entry compares with Snell's law (L2016-2025) and the FE entry with 48 EI / L^3 (L1946-1955) — numerical parity, not empirical validation (-3); the FE model under-predicts the only empirical toughness anchor by 5.2x and the Pass 2 eta-law by 5.3x, and the discrepancy is reported but not resolved (-3); the 0.1333 reference is a recalled number, unverified (-1); no comparison with measured basalia NA or mode images from Sundar 2003 / Aizenberg 2004 (-1)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/sponge_spicule_hexactin/sponge_spicule_hexactin_reference.json L76–L88: cross_taxa table: theta_obs_deg within 0.2 deg of theta_pred_deg and toughness_ratio_obs = 1 + 0.32 N within 0.03 for every species; no per-row source <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a69596cc/datasets/sponge_spicule_hexactin/sponge_spicule_hexactin_reference.json#L76-L88>",
            "models/2012-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin.py L1855–L1874: 12-species r_angle and r_toughness = 1.0000 against Pass 1 recalled theta_obs_deg / toughness_ratio_obs that sit on the model laws (self-referential) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a69596cc/models/2012-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin.py#L1855-L1874>",
            "models/2012-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin.py L1976–L1985: k_cat -> N wild type = 25 with reference 25: calibrated by construction (flagged in the entry text) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a69596cc/models/2012-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin.py#L1976-L1985>",
            "models/2012-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin.py L2006–L2025: Ovalization gain exact-sum vs closed-form identity and ray-trace vs arccos(n_clad / n_core): numerical parity checks, not specimen comparisons <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a69596cc/models/2012-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin.py#L2006-L2025>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-12-species-concentric-lamellar-fracture-toughness-correlation-g-lam-g-mono-1-eta-n>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-12-species-porifera-silicatein-inter-ray-symmetry-angle-correlation-o-h-90-t-d-109-47-d-3h-120-d-inf-h-180>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-3d-accreted-demospongiae-t-d-tetractin-calthrop-tetrahedral-inter-ray-angle-arccos-1-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-3d-accreted-hexactinellida-o-h-hexactin-orthogonal-inter-ray-angle>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-basalia-waveguide-guided-lp-mode-groups-at-550-nm-core-a-from-lamella-2-vs-gloge-v-2-2-total-mode-estimate>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-basalia-waveguide-ray-traced-acceptance-angle-vs-analytic-arccos-n-clad-n-core>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-cohesive-zone-laminate-work-of-fracture-ratio-w-lam-w-mono-under-three-point-bending-n-25-g-i-1-2-j-m-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-concentric-biosilica-lamellar-radial-thinning-exponent-alpha-h-n-prop-r-n-alpha>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-euplectella-alternating-checkerboard-diagonal-bracing-shear-stiffness-amplification-f-diag-0-5-vs-unbraced-f-diag-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-euplectella-specimen-segmented-orthogonal-hexactin-strut-intersection-angle-euplectella-aspergillum-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-euplectella-specimen-segmented-square-lattice-pitch-euplectella-aspergillum-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-external-helical-ridge-angle-maximising-cage-torsional-stiffness-sin-2-2-psi-projection>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-fe-three-point-bending-analytic-parity-hermite-beam-midspan-stiffness-vs-48-ei-l-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-fused-interlayer-ablation-g-i-g-s-he-hutchinson-ratio-1-0-work-of-fracture-ratio-vs-monolith>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-ovalization-buckling-second-moment-gain-of-the-cage-from-n-r-8-equally-spaced-ridges-i-eff-i-wall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-peripheral-to-central-lamella-thickness-ratio-h-25-h-1-model-vs-aizenberg-et-al-2005-0-2-um-1-5-um>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-silicatein-inhibited-si-starved-ablation-negative-control-accreted-spicule-rays-k-cat-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-silicatein-k-cat-ablation-3d-accreted-cross-section-effective-lamella-count-wild-type>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-morphometric-validation-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-morphometric-validation-2> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.84"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-measurement-12-species-concentric-lamellar-fracture-toughness-correlation-g-lam-g-mono-1-eta-n> a schema:PropertyValue,
